        {
          "text": "Ensi yabo yayemaga Mahanaimu, ekwata Bashani yona, obukama bwona bwa Ogi omukama wa Bashani n'ebyaro byona bya Yairi omuli Bashani, ebigo 60; ",
          "type": "text",
